   "title": "N. Korea opens annual trade fair amid sanctions",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261027/n-korea-opens-annual-trade-fair-amid-sanctions",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
