   "_dt": 1793034589.0,
   "ageDays": 0.53,
   "summary": "The packages, which take effect on November 5, 2026, were unveiled at a joint press briefing organised by the Ministry of Communications, Digital Technology and Innovation and MultiChoice Ghana on Monday, October 26. For sports enthusiasts, the Sports Pack, priced at GH¢250 per month, provides football coverage alongside channels available under the Starter and Select packages.",
   "summary_zh": "这些套餐将于2026年11月5日生效，由通信、数字技术与创新部和加纳MultiChoice于10月26日星期一举行的联合新闻发布会上公布。对体育爱好者而言，每月售价GH¢250的体育套餐提供足球赛事报道，以及入门套餐和精选套餐中已有的频道。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The packages, which take effect on November 5, 2026, were unveiled at a joint press briefing organised by the Ministry of Communications, Digital Technology and Innovation and MultiChoice Ghana on Monday, October 26. Under the new arrangement, the Starter Pack, priced at GH¢50 per month, provides access to 90 television channels, making it the most affordable option. For sports enthusiasts, the Sports Pack, priced at GH¢250 per month, provides football coverage alongside channels available under the Starter and Select packages. The Ultimate Pack, costing GH¢570 monthly, is the highest-priced option, combining premium sports coverage with a wider selection of entertainment content. MultiChoice Ghana explained that the revised subscription structure is intended to give customers greater flexibility in choosing packages that meet their entertainment needs and financial circumstances",
