   "title": "NDC Inaugurates New Headquarters, Presents CoR To Candidates",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/ndc-inaugurates-new-headquarters-presents-cor-to-candidates/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:54:44 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792947284.0,
   "ageDays": 1.54,
   "summary": "“The inauguration of the National Campaign Council (NCC) and presentation of Certificates of Return to candidates of the party will commence at *5:00 pm*. “Attendance at the NCC inauguration is restricted to members of the National Working Committee (NWC), the Presidential Candidate and his Running Mate, Governorship Candidates, and National Assembly Candidates only.",
   "summary_zh": "“全国竞选委员会（NCC）的成立仪式以及向该党候选人颁发当选证书的活动将于下午5:00开始。出席NCC成立仪式的人员仅限全国工作委员会（NWC）成员、总统候选人及其竞选搭档、州长候选人以及国民议会候选人。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "National Publicity Secretary of the party, Osa Director disclosed this in a statement on Sunday. It also restated that the NDC would hold its National Executive Committee (NEC) meeting in Abuja earlier Monday. “The National Executive Committee (NEC) of the National Democratic Congress (NDC) wishes to announce its programme of activities scheduled for Monday, 26th October, 2026. The activities are as follows: the meeting of the National Executive Committee (NEC) of the party will hold as follows: Date: Monday, 26th October, 2026. Time: 10:00 am prompt Venue: JD Vance Centre, opposite A-Class Park, Kashim Ibrahim Way, Maitama, Abuja. Please note that admission is strictly by invitation, and only members of the NEC shall be admitted. “The commissioning of the newly acquired National Secretariat of the party located in Jabi, Abuja, will take place at *2:00 pm* on the same day. “The inauguration of the National Campaign Council (NCC) and presentation of Certificates of Return to candidates of the party will commence at *5:00 pm*. This will be followed by a dinner. “Attendance at the NCC inauguration is restricted to members of the National Working Committee (NWC), the Presidential Candidate and his Running Mate, Governorship Candidates, and National Assembly Candidates only. “We appreciate the continued support and loyalty of our members across the country. Together, we can make a New Nigeria Possible,”the statement read. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
